<title>POLAND: EFEKT NOV NET RISES TO PLN 0.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>EFEKT NOV NET RISES TO PLN 0.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results November</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.16 vs   0.10</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.28 vs   0.17</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.03 vs   0.10</p>
<p> Sales		    2.12 vs   1.05</p>
